ive up (PLACES SIS section 3.9.3). No radius conversion, fitted bias or translation. Bounded 28.31 MB source row range; full raster not downloaded.</p><p class="supporting">25 x 25 complete-post means, then Horn 3 x 3 gradients (75 m support). East metre spacing corrected by cos(latitude). Slope in degrees; hillshade artificial azimuth315 degrees / altitude45 degrees. No exaggeration or cast shadows.</p><p class="supporting">All 1,102,500 input posts valid; derived support 40 x 40 cells, outside transparent. Reproduction: team/gale/prepare_g3_2_dem.py; hashes and gate decisions: team/gale/G3_2_DEM_AUDIT.json.</p><p class="supporting">Precise local alignment to CTX is NOT verified. Direct mission-orthophoto/CTX check suggests positional mismatch. Published coordinates retained; full-opacity independent views by default. Do not match fine features between products.</p><p class="supporting">Mixed HiRISE/CTX lineage without per-pixel resolving-power or error map. 25 m analysis grid and 75 m derivative support do not certify effective spatial resolution. Absolute elevation, horizontal and slope error unquantified.</p><p class="supporting">1 km projected square only, not whole Gale or all rover exploration. Archive release time span is not stereo acquisition time. No hazard, astronaut-safety, routing or resource conclusions.</p></details></div></section><section aria-label="Thermal" data-scientific-category="Thermal"><h3>Thermal</h3><p class="supporting">Qualitative infrared mosaic brightness. This display is not calibrated temperature or thermal inertia; observation context differs by source.</p><p class="supporting">No dataset available.</p></section><section aria-label="Basemaps"><h3>Basemaps</h3><p class="supporting">Optical context and mission imagery.</p><p class="supporting">No dataset available.</p></section><section aria-label="Map overlays"><h3>Map overlays</h3><p class="supporting">Recorded traverses and dataset coverage outlines; these do not establish waypoin